      "message": "suggest to call this \"log\", \"onLog\", etc. \n\n\"Fastboot\" and \"Cb\" is not necessary because it is in the interface name.\n\nAlso, it looks like this is not really a \"callback\" conceptually. Maybe change this to \"IFastbootLogger\" and change setCallback to setLogger? Unless there are more APIs to be added to the callback interface.\n\nAlso, oneway? Does it care if the log is not successful?",
